+Guardrails: Risk Mitigation Runbook & Implementation Notes
+-------------------------------------------------------
+
+This patch adds multiple safety and mitigation components:
+- Hard-policy enforcer (services/policy/hard_policy_enforcer.py): enforces forbidden terms, token limits, and evidence_required policy paths.
